  "Tabla, Mridangam, Kanjira, Ghatam, Dholak, Darbuka, Daf, Zarb, Davul, Naqareh, Manjira, Sagat und mehr, eigene Synthese. Dichte, Komplexität, Variation und Polyrhythmus in der Spur.": ["Tabla, Mridangam, Kanjira, Ghatam, Dholak, Darbuka, Daf, Zarb, Davul, Naqareh, Manjira, Sagat and more, own synthesis. Density, complexity, variation and polyrhythm in the track.","Tabla, Mridangam, Kanjira, Ghatam, Dholak, Darbuka, Daf, Zarb, Davul, Naqareh, Manjira, Sagat y más, síntesis propia. Densidad, complejidad, variación y polirritmo en la pista.","Tabla, Mridangam, Kanjira, Ghatam, Dholak, Darbuka, Daf, Zarb, Davul, Naqareh, Manjira, Sagat et plus, synthèse maison. Densité, complexité, variation et polyrythmie dans la piste."],
